      ],
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Syariah Court Civil Procedure (Federal Territories) (Amendment) Bill 2024"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Syariah Court Civil Procedure (Federal Territories) (Amendment) Act 2024."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act comes into operation on a date to be appointed by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong by notification in the Gazette. Amendment of section 3"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Syariah Court Civil Procedure (Federal Territories) Act 1998 [Act 585], which is referred to as the “principal Act” in this Act, is amended in subsection 3(1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the English text, in the definition of “Registrar”, by substituting for the full stop at the end of the definition a semicolon; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the definition of “Registrar” the following definition: ‘ “remote communication technology” has the meaning assigned to it in section 40 a of the Administration Act.’. Substitution of section 34"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The principal Act is amended by substituting for section 34 the following section: “Wakalah 34. (1) The appointment of a Peguam Syarie shall be pronounced by the person who appoints him and accepted by the Peguam Syarie so appointed before the Peguam Syarie commences any action on behalf of the person appointing him. (2) The appointment and the acceptance of appointment under subsection (1) shall be made in Form MS 5 and shall be filed in Court.”. Amendment of section 100"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 100 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after the words “in open Court” the words “or through a remote communication technology”. Amendment of section 109"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 109 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in the shoulder note, by inserting after the word “prisoner” the words “or detained person”; (Amendment)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (1), by inserting after the words “a prison” the words “or detained under any written law, who is a witness or party in a proceeding,”; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “the witness in safe custody” the words “the person referred to in subsection (1)”. Amendment of section 119"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Section 119 of the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by renumbering the existing section as subsection (1); and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by inserting after the renumbered subsection (1) the following subsection: “(2) The Court shall have the power to hear any cause or matter or any part thereof in camera if the Court is satisfied that it is expedient in the interests of justice, public safety, public security or propriety, or for other sufficient reason so to do.”. Amendment of section 247"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subsection 247(1) of the principal Act is amended by inserting after paragraph (a) the following paragraph: “(aa) the procedure and practice of the proceedings conducted at any place other than the Court or through remote communication technology;”. Amendment of Third Schedule"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_d"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Third Schedule to the principal Act is amended—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in Form MS 3, by substituting for the word “defendant” the word “respondent”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in Form MS 5, by deleting “Before me, ......................….... Judge/Registrar”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_c__subpara_i",
