        "@value": "in paragraph 1, by substituting for the words “a prisoner confined in the prison/place of detention” the words “*a person confined in the prison/detained under any written law”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2024/20/eng@/~cl_8__para_c__subpara_iii",
